# Pilger: friendly pilgrim on the Falkenstein trail (Steinetragen custom).
# Green felt hat G/g/j with a small brass badge Y, grey hair and a white
# moustache w/i, brown loden jacket O/l with a backpack strap l, grey
# Kniebundhose m/d, grey wool socks i/m, leather shoes O/l. Prop: a green
# backpack G/g/j with a grey penance stone i/m/d (l rope) strapped on top,
# poking up behind his head - the 1x read; plus one plain wooden walking
# stick O (not two poles: that is the Nordic-Walker). No religious props.
# walk: 0 = stride, stick planted on the ground; 1 = passing, 1 px bob up,
# stick lifted. squished = he sat down on his stone for a rest, hat pushed
# back (a rest, not a squash). Faces right; mirror = auto.
# Built with a layered scratch script (parts + per-part k outline), frozen
# to text here.
sprite = pilger
size   = 16x24
origin = 8,24
hitbox = 2,2,12,22
mirror = auto
anim   = walk     frames=2 ticks=12 loop
anim   = squished frames=1
